                                                "sense_id": "5e8b7815-7ca0-3c0e-b65f-67ccaaa9cbd5",
                                                "text": "A U235 bomb would therefore need to incorporate a gun weighing ten tons. Then there was the question of initiating or triggering the bomb."
                                            }
